:: tortRafters
<<scenery tortRafters>>
You are currently in the corner of your basement where you suspend slaves from the rafters.
<<unlessEmergency>>\
    <<slaveEvents TortRafters>>
    <div class="row">\
        <div class="one-half column">\
            <<set _slaves = TortRafters.getSlaves()>>\
            <<if _slaves.length > 0>>\
                Approach slave:
                <<set _charcode = 97>>\
                <<for _slave range _slaves>><<if _slave.location == 'tortRafters'>>\
                    <<set 
                        if(_charcode == 104) _charcode += 2; 
                        _char = String.fromCharCode(_charcode++);
                        _keyId = _char + "KeyAct";
                        _action = "<<openNpcInteraction slave " + _slave.uid + ">>";
                        _prefix = "(" + _char.toUpperCase() + ")"
                    >>\
                    <span @id="_keyId">\
                        <<printPersonLink _slave _action _prefix>>
                    </span>\
                <</if>><</for>>\
            <</if>>\
        </div>\
    </div>
    <<keyOption [[Return to main basement|basement]] 🚪>>\
    <<include workOption>>\
<</unlessEmergency>>\